{"recipe_title":"Pepperoni Pasta Bake","recipe_author":"<p>

Melanie Richtman

</p>","recipe_description":"<p>Perfect Dinner Recipe</p><p>Cookware used: <a href="https://www.360cookware.com/products/9-x-13-stainless-steel-bake-roast-pan?_pos=1&amp;_psq=9%22+x+13%22+Bake+%26+Roast+Pan+with+Handles&amp;_ss=e&amp;_v=1.0" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">9" x 13" Bake &amp; Roast Pan with Handles</a></p><p><br /></p>","recipe_category":"","recipe_cuisine":"","recipe_ingredients":[{"id":"8-split-0-1775059837950","type":"ingredient","index":9,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>12 oz box of tricolor rotini</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"8-split-1-1775059837950","type":"ingredient","index":10,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>1 large jar of tomato sauce</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"8-split-2-1775059837950","type":"ingredient","index":11,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>2 cups of shredded mozzarella cheese</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"8-split-3-1775059837950","type":"ingredient","index":12,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>1 pound of Italian sausage (hot or sweet, as desired)</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"8-split-4-1775059837950","type":"ingredient","index":13,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>6 oz of pepperoni</p>","selected_product":null}],"recipe_directions":[{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-0-1775059843770","type":"direction","image":null,"index":2,"direction":"<p>Preheat the oven to 375 degrees.</p>"},{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-1-1775059843770","type":"direction","image":null,"index":3,"direction":"<p>Boil water and cook the pasta according to the package instructions.</p>"},{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-2-1775059843771","type":"direction","image":null,"index":4,"direction":"<p>In the meantime, brown the sausage on the stove.</p>"},{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-3-1775059843771","type":"direction","image":null,"index":5,"direction":"<p>Once the pasta is cooked and drained, add it to a bowl with the italian sausage and tomato sauce, and mix.</p>"},{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-4-1775059843771","type":"direction","image":null,"index":6,"direction":"<p>Place half of the pasta mixture in a 9x13 stainless steel bake and roast pan. Top with pepperoni and mozzarella cheese. Place the remaining pasta mixture in the pan. Top with pepperoni and mozzarella. Cover with foil.</p>"},{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-5-1775059843771","type":"direction","image":null,"index":7,"direction":"<p>Bake the pasta dish for about 45 minutes, then remove the foil, and bake for another 10 minutes, or until the cheese is melted.</p>"}],"serving_size":"","prep_time":null,"cook_time":null,"recipe_image":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0622/1937/files/Pepperoni_Pasta_Bake_Blog_Photo.jpg?v=1775059603","recipe_image_alt_text":"Pepperoni Pasta Bake","iso_prep_time":null,"iso_cook_time":null,"recipe_rating":"4.0000000000000000","enable_rating":true,"rating_count":"8","recipe_note":"","recipe_video":"","recipe_date":"2026-04-01T16:09:44.325+00:00","recipe_calories":null,"recipe_tags":[],"nutrition_data":[],"recipe_id":"2633227","nutrition_serving_size":"","nutrition_template":"horizontal","custom_fields":[]}

{"recipe_title":"One-Pan Peri Peri Chicken Thighs with Rice","recipe_author":"<p>

Melanie Richtman

</p>","recipe_description":"<p>Perfect Dinner Recipe</p><p>Cookware used: <a href="https://www.360cookware.com/products/stainless-steel-3-5-quart-saute-pan-with-cover" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">3.5 Quart Sauté Pan with Cover</a></p><p><br /></p>","recipe_category":"","recipe_cuisine":"","recipe_ingredients":[{"id":1776103545472,"type":"heading","index":14,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"blank","heading_text":"<p><strong>For the chicken:</strong></p>"},{"id":"15-split-0-1776103554061","type":"ingredient","index":16,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>1 ½ lbs of boneless, skinless chicken thighs</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"15-split-1-1776103554061","type":"ingredient","index":17,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>1 teaspoon of chili powder</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"15-split-2-1776103554061","type":"ingredient","index":18,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>1 teaspoon of paprika</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"15-split-3-1776103554061","type":"ingredient","index":19,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>1 teaspoon of garlic powder</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"15-split-4-1776103554061","type":"ingredient","index":20,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>1 teaspoon of onion powder</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"15-split-5-1776103554061","type":"ingredient","index":21,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>½ teaspoon of turmeric powder</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"15-split-6-1776103554061","type":"ingredient","index":22,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>Ghee</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"15-split-7-1776103554061","type":"ingredient","index":23,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>Salt and pepper to taste</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"15-split-8-1776103554061","type":"ingredient","index":24,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>Peri peri hot sauce</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":1776103561680,"type":"heading","index":25,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"blank","heading_text":"<p><strong>For the rice:</strong></p>"},{"id":"26-split-0-1776103567673","type":"ingredient","index":27,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>1 red bell pepper, diced</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"26-split-1-1776103567673","type":"ingredient","index":28,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>½ of a yellow onion, diced</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"26-split-2-1776103567673","type":"ingredient","index":29,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>3 cloves of garlic</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"26-split-3-1776103567673","type":"ingredient","index":30,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>1 ½ cups of basmati rice</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"26-split-4-1776103567673","type":"ingredient","index":31,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>2 ¼ cups of chicken broth</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"26-split-5-1776103567674","type":"ingredient","index":32,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>1 cup of frozen peas</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"26-split-6-1776103567674","type":"ingredient","index":33,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>Salt and pepper to taste</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"26-split-7-1776103567674","type":"ingredient","index":34,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>Cilantro for garnish, if desired</p>","selected_product":null}],"recipe_directions":[{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-5-1775059843771-split-0-1776103578417","type":"direction","image":null,"index":8,"direction":"<p>Marinate the chicken thighs in the olive oil, chili powder, paprika, garlic powder, onion powder, turmeric, and salt and pepper.</p>"},{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-5-1775059843771-split-1-1776103578417","type":"direction","image":null,"index":9,"direction":"<p>Preheat your stainless steel pan for a few minutes. Once it’s properly preheated, add a little ghee to the pan, and add the chicken thighs.</p>"},{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-5-1775059843771-split-2-1776103578417","type":"direction","image":null,"index":10,"direction":"<p>Brown the chicken thighs for a few minutes per side, then set to the side.</p>"},{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-5-1775059843771-split-3-1776103578417","type":"direction","image":null,"index":11,"direction":"<p>Add a little more ghee to the pan, then add the diced peppers, onions, and garlic to the pan to saute for a few minutes.</p>"},{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-5-1775059843771-split-4-1776103578417","type":"direction","image":null,"index":12,"direction":"<p>Rinse the rice, and then add it to the pan, along with the chicken broth. Add the frozen peas, and bring to a simmer.</p>"},{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-5-1775059843771-split-5-1776103578417","type":"direction","image":null,"index":13,"direction":"<p>Add the chicken thighs back to the pan, cover, and simmer for 25 minutes or until the rice is fully cooked.</p>"},{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-5-1775059843771-split-6-1776103578417","type":"direction","image":null,"index":14,"direction":"<p>Once everything is cooked, top the chicken with peri peri sauce and sprinkle with cilantro if desired.</p>"}],"serving_size":"","prep_time":null,"cook_time":null,"recipe_image":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0622/1937/files/Peri_Peri_Blog_Photo.jpg?v=1776103458","recipe_image_alt_text":"One-Pan Peri Peri Chicken Thighs with Rice","iso_prep_time":null,"iso_cook_time":null,"recipe_rating":"3.0000000000000000","enable_rating":true,"rating_count":"2","recipe_note":"","recipe_video":"","recipe_date":"2026-04-13T18:05:01.608+00:00","recipe_calories":null,"recipe_tags":[],"nutrition_data":[],"recipe_id":"2668845","nutrition_serving_size":"","nutrition_template":"horizontal","custom_fields":[]}

{"recipe_title":"Asparagus Tart","recipe_author":"<p>

Melanie Richtman

</p>","recipe_description":"<p>Perfect Dinner Recipe</p><p>Cookware used: <a href="https://www.360cookware.com/products/stainless-steel-jelly-roll-pan" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Jelly Roll Pan</a></p><p><br /></p>","recipe_category":"","recipe_cuisine":"","recipe_ingredients":[{"id":"8-split-0-1775059837950-split-0-1776103889898","type":"ingredient","index":10,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>½ bunch of asparagus, ends trimmed</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"8-split-0-1775059837950-split-1-1776103889898","type":"ingredient","index":11,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>1 sheet of frozen puff pastry, thawed</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"8-split-0-1775059837950-split-2-1776103889898","type":"ingredient","index":12,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>1 package of Boursin cheese (We used Garlic &amp; Fine Herbs, but any flavor would work!)</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"8-split-0-1775059837950-split-3-1776103889898","type":"ingredient","index":13,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>1 egg</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"8-split-0-1775059837950-split-4-1776103889898","type":"ingredient","index":14,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>½ cup of grated parmesan cheese</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"8-split-0-1775059837950-split-5-1776103889898","type":"ingredient","index":15,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>Salt and pepper to taste</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"8-split-0-1775059837950-split-6-1776103889898","type":"ingredient","index":16,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>All-purpose flour</p>","selected_product":null}],"recipe_directions":[{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-5-1775059843771-split-0-1776103899914","type":"direction","image":null,"index":8,"direction":"<p>Preheat the oven to 375 degrees fahrenheit</p>"},{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-5-1775059843771-split-1-1776103899914","type":"direction","image":null,"index":9,"direction":"<p>Trim the ends of the asparagus, and grate the parmesan cheese, and set aside</p>"},{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-5-1775059843771-split-2-1776103899914","type":"direction","image":null,"index":10,"direction":"<p>Place a little flour on a baking mat and roll out the puff pastry dough</p>"},{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-5-1775059843771-split-3-1776103899914","type":"direction","image":null,"index":11,"direction":"<p>Lightly grease your stainless steel jelly roll pan, and place the puff pastry dough on it</p>"},{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-5-1775059843771-split-4-1776103899914","type":"direction","image":null,"index":12,"direction":"<p>Use a sharp knife to score the puff pastry and create a 1 inch border</p>"},{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-5-1775059843771-split-5-1776103899914","type":"direction","image":null,"index":13,"direction":"<p>Spread the Boursin cheese on the puff pastry dough, then add the asparagus</p>"},{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-5-1775059843771-split-6-1776103899914","type":"direction","image":null,"index":14,"direction":"<p>Top with grated parmesan cheese, salt, and pepper</p>"},{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-5-1775059843771-split-7-1776103899914","type":"direction","image":null,"index":15,"direction":"<p>Create an egg wash by mixing one egg with some water, and brush along the border</p>"},{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-5-1775059843771-split-8-1776103899914","type":"direction","image":null,"index":16,"direction":"<p>Bake for roughly 28-30 minutes or until the edges are golden brown</p>"}],"serving_size":"","prep_time":null,"cook_time":null,"recipe_image":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0622/1937/files/Asparagus_Tart_Blog_Photo.jpg?v=1776103847","recipe_image_alt_text":"Asparagus Tart","iso_prep_time":null,"iso_cook_time":null,"recipe_rating":"3.0000000000000000","enable_rating":true,"rating_count":"2","recipe_note":"","recipe_video":"","recipe_date":"2026-04-13T18:10:47.857+00:00","recipe_calories":null,"recipe_tags":[],"nutrition_data":[],"recipe_id":"2668856","nutrition_serving_size":"","nutrition_template":"horizontal","custom_fields":[]}

{"recipe_title":"Jalapeno Popper Grilled Cheese","recipe_author":"<p>

Melanie Richtman

</p>","recipe_description":"<p>Perfect Dinner Recipe</p><p>Cookware used: <a href="https://www.360cookware.com/products/stainless-steel-8-5-inch-fry-pan" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">8.5 Inch Fry Pan</a></p><p><br /></p>","recipe_category":"","recipe_cuisine":"","recipe_ingredients":[{"id":"8-split-4-1775059837950-split-0-1776104005576","type":"ingredient","index":14,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>1 block of softened cream cheese</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"8-split-4-1775059837950-split-1-1776104005576","type":"ingredient","index":15,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>½ cup of shredded cheddar cheese</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"8-split-4-1775059837950-split-2-1776104005576","type":"ingredient","index":16,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>2 tablespoons of diced jalapeno peppers, fresh or pickled</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"8-split-4-1775059837950-split-3-1776104005576","type":"ingredient","index":17,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>½  teaspoon of onion powder</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"8-split-4-1775059837950-split-4-1776104005576","type":"ingredient","index":18,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>½ teaspoon of garlic powder</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"8-split-4-1775059837950-split-5-1776104005576","type":"ingredient","index":19,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>8 slices of Sourdough bread</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"8-split-4-1775059837950-split-6-1776104005576","type":"ingredient","index":20,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>Mayonnaise</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"8-split-4-1775059837950-split-7-1776104005576","type":"ingredient","index":21,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>Butter or ghee</p>","selected_product":null}],"recipe_directions":[{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-5-1775059843771-split-0-1776104016655","type":"direction","image":null,"index":8,"direction":"<p>Preheat your stainless steel pan on medium low heat for a few minutes</p>"},{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-5-1775059843771-split-1-1776104016655","type":"direction","image":null,"index":9,"direction":"<p>In a bowl, combine the cream cheese, cheddar cheese, jalapenos, onion powder, and garlic powder</p>"},{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-5-1775059843771-split-2-1776104016655","type":"direction","image":null,"index":10,"direction":"<p>Place mayonnaise on one side of each piece of bread</p>"},{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-5-1775059843771-split-3-1776104016655","type":"direction","image":null,"index":11,"direction":"<p>Spread the cheese mixture on four slices of bread, topping with additional shredded cheddar cheese as desired</p>"},{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-5-1775059843771-split-4-1776104016655","type":"direction","image":null,"index":12,"direction":"<p>Add a little butter or ghee to the pan, and place the sandwich on the pan for 2-3 minutes per side, until the bread is golden brown and the cheese is melted</p>"}],"serving_size":"","prep_time":"","cook_time":"","recipe_image":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0622/1937/files/Jalapeno_Popper_Grilled_Cheese_Blog_Photo.jpg?v=1776103979","recipe_image_alt_text":"Jalapeno Popper Grilled Cheese","recipe_rating":"5.0000000000000000","enable_rating":true,"rating_count":"1","recipe_note":"","recipe_video":"","recipe_date":"2026-04-13T18:12:22.090+00:00","recipe_calories":null,"recipe_tags":[],"nutrition_data":[],"recipe_id":"2668867","nutrition_serving_size":"","nutrition_template":"horizontal","custom_fields":[]}

