</p>","recipe_description":"<p>Perfect Dinner Recipe</p><p>Cookware used: <a href="https://www.360cookware.com/products/stainless-steel-2-quart-saucepan-with-cover" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">2 Quart Saucepan with Cover</a></p><p><br /></p>","recipe_category":"","recipe_cuisine":"","recipe_ingredients":[{"id":"8-split-4-1775059837950-split-0-1776104112728","type":"ingredient","index":14,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>1 lb of pasta</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"8-split-4-1775059837950-split-1-1776104112729","type":"ingredient","index":15,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>1 cup of corn (fresh or canned)</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"8-split-4-1775059837950-split-2-1776104112729","type":"ingredient","index":16,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>1 jalapeno, diced</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"8-split-4-1775059837950-split-3-1776104112729","type":"ingredient","index":17,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>3 green onions, diced</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"8-split-4-1775059837950-split-4-1776104112729","type":"ingredient","index":18,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>1 red bell pepper, diced</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"8-split-4-1775059837950-split-5-1776104112729","type":"ingredient","index":19,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>½ cup of chopped cilantro</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"8-split-4-1775059837950-split-6-1776104112729","type":"ingredient","index":20,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>1 cup of crumbled Cojita cheese</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"8-split-4-1775059837950-split-7-1776104112729","type":"ingredient","index":21,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>½ cup of sour cream</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"8-split-4-1775059837950-split-8-1776104112729","type":"ingredient","index":22,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>½ cup of mayonnaise</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"8-split-4-1775059837950-split-9-1776104112729","type":"ingredient","index":23,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>1 teaspoon of paprika</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"8-split-4-1775059837950-split-10-1776104112729","type":"ingredient","index":24,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>1 teaspoon of chili powder</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"8-split-4-1775059837950-split-11-1776104112729","type":"ingredient","index":25,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>1 teaspoon of garlic powder</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"8-split-4-1775059837950-split-12-1776104112729","type":"ingredient","index":26,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>Juice of one lime</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"8-split-4-1775059837950-split-13-1776104112729","type":"ingredient","index":27,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>Salt and pepper to taste</p>","selected_product":null},{"id":"8-split-4-1775059837950-split-14-1776104112729","type":"ingredient","index":28,"isNew":true,"ingredient":"<p>Tajin for garnish, if desired</p>","selected_product":null}],"recipe_directions":[{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-5-1775059843771-split-3-1776104122664-split-0-1776104133278","type":"direction","image":null,"index":12,"direction":"<p>Cook the pasta according to package instructions and set aside to cool.</p>"},{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-5-1775059843771-split-3-1776104122664-split-1-1776104133278","type":"direction","image":null,"index":13,"direction":"<p>Make the dressing by combining the sour cream, mayonnaise, paprika, chili powder, garlic powder, and lime juice.</p>"},{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-5-1775059843771-split-3-1776104122664-split-2-1776104133278","type":"direction","image":null,"index":14,"direction":"<p>Add the pasta, corn, jalapeno, red bell pepper, green onions, cilantro, and cojita cheese and mix.</p>"},{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-5-1775059843771-split-3-1776104122664-split-3-1776104133278","type":"direction","image":null,"index":15,"direction":"<p>Add in the dressing and stir to combine.</p>"},{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-5-1775059843771-split-3-1776104122664-split-4-1776104133278","type":"direction","image":null,"index":16,"direction":"<p>Top with additional Cojita cheese and tajin, as desired.</p>"}],"serving_size":"","prep_time":null,"cook_time":null,"recipe_image":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0622/1937/files/Elote_Pasta_Salad_Blog_Photo.jpg?v=1776104065","recipe_image_alt_text":"Elote Pasta Salad","iso_prep_time":null,"iso_cook_time":null,"recipe_rating":"3.0000000000000000","enable_rating":true,"rating_count":"6","recipe_note":"","recipe_video":"","recipe_date":"2026-04-13T18:14:39.270+00:00","recipe_calories":null,"recipe_tags":[],"nutrition_data":[],"recipe_id":"2668878","nutrition_serving_size":"","nutrition_template":"horizontal","custom_fields":[]}

