151121-split-1-1777312319520","type":"direction","image":null,"index":24,"direction":"<p>In a large bowl, whisk together the sourdough starter discard, milk, melted butter, honey, eggs, and vanilla extract until smooth.</p>"},{"id":1777312343219,"type":"heading","index":36,"direction":"blank","heading_text":"<p>Combine the dry ingredients</p>"},{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-5-1775059843771-split-9-1776104424006-split-4-1777312151121-split-3-1777312319520","type":"direction","image":null,"index":26,"direction":"<p>In a separate bowl, sift together the flour, matcha powder, baking powder, and salt. Sifting helps prevent clumps—especially important with matcha.</p>"},{"id":1777312351803,"type":"heading","index":37,"direction":"blank","heading_text":"<p>Make the batter</p>"},{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-5-1775059843771-split-9-1776104424006-split-4-1777312151121-split-5-1777312319520","type":"direction","image":null,"index":28,"direction":"<p>Gradually add the dry ingredients into the wet mixture, stirring gently until just combined. Be careful not to overmix; a few lumps are fine.</p>"},{"id":1777312362844,"type":"heading","index":38,"direction":"blank","heading_text":"<p>Rest the batter (optional but recommended)</p>"},{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-5-1775059843771-split-9-1776104424006-split-4-1777312151121-split-7-1777312319520","type":"direction","image":null,"index":30,"direction":"<p>Let the batter sit for 5–10 minutes. This allows the flour to hydrate and gives you fluffier pancakes.</p>"},{"id":1777312368411,"type":"heading","index":39,"direction":"blank","heading_text":"<p>Cook the pancakes</p>"},{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-5-1775059843771-split-9-1776104424006-split-4-1777312151121-split-9-1777312319520","type":"direction","image":null,"index":32,"direction":"<p>Heat a non-stick pan or griddle over medium heat and lightly grease it. Pour about 1/4 cup of batter for each pancake. Cook until bubbles form on the surface (about 2–3 minutes), then flip and cook for another 1–2 minutes until done.</p>"},{"id":1777312373771,"type":"heading","index":40,"direction":"blank","heading_text":"<p>Serve and enjoy</p>"},{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-5-1775059843771-split-9-1776104424006-split-4-1777312151121-split-11-1777312319520","type":"direction","image":null,"index":34,"direction":"<p>Serve warm with butter, maple syrup, fresh fruit, or a dusting of powdered sugar.</p>"}],"serving_size":"","prep_time":null,"cook_time":null,"recipe_image":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0622/1937/files/20260414-114532291.jpg?v=1777312243","recipe_image_alt_text":"Sourdough Discard Matcha Pancakes","iso_prep_time":null,"iso_cook_time":null,"recipe_rating":"3.1428571428571429","enable_rating":true,"rating_count":"7","recipe_note":"","recipe_video":"","recipe_date":"2026-04-27T17:50:57.240+00:00","recipe_calories":null,"recipe_tags":[],"nutrition_data":[],"recipe_id":"2707807","nutrition_serving_size":"","nutrition_template":"horizontal","custom_fields":[]}

