the pan and stir. The sauce will continue to thicken and emulsify, and you can add more butter as desired.</p>"},{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-5-1775059843771-split-9-1776104424006-split-4-1777312151121-split-11-1777312319520-split-3-1777990336148","type":"direction","image":null,"index":38,"direction":"<p>Add salt to taste and fresh herbs, like dill, if desired</p>"},{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-5-1775059843771-split-9-1776104424006-split-4-1777312151121-split-11-1777312319520-split-4-1777990336148","type":"direction","image":null,"index":39,"direction":"<p>Plate your vegetables and serve with the Beurre au Citron</p>"}],"serving_size":"","prep_time":null,"cook_time":null,"recipe_image":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0622/1937/files/Beurre_Au_Citron_Blog_Photo.jpg?v=1777990271","recipe_image_alt_text":"Beurre Au Citron in a stainless steel pan","iso_prep_time":null,"iso_cook_time":null,"recipe_rating":"2.2500000000000000","enable_rating":true,"rating_count":"4","recipe_note":"","recipe_video":"","recipe_date":"2026-05-05T14:11:23.354+00:00","recipe_calories":null,"recipe_tags":[],"nutrition_data":[],"recipe_id":"2716343","nutrition_serving_size":"","nutrition_template":"horizontal","custom_fields":[]}

