er to create a dry rub and rub it all over the pork.</p>"},{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-5-1775059843771-split-9-1776104424006-split-4-1777312151121-split-11-1777312319520-split-4-1777990336148-split-7-1778870302697-split-11-1779997678720-split-21-1780342111846-split-2-1780342168799","type":"direction","image":null,"index":84,"direction":"<p>Place some oil in your stainless steel slow cooker pot and sear both sides of the pork for 3-5 minutes per side.</p>"},{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-5-1775059843771-split-9-1776104424006-split-4-1777312151121-split-11-1777312319520-split-4-1777990336148-split-7-1778870302697-split-11-1779997678720-split-21-1780342111846-split-3-1780342168799","type":"direction","image":null,"index":85,"direction":"<p>Move the slow cooker pot to the slow cooker base and add the apple cider vinegar and apple juice. Cover, and cook on low heat for 8 hours or until the meat is fork tender.</p>"},{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-5-1775059843771-split-9-1776104424006-split-4-1777312151121-split-11-1777312319520-split-4-1777990336148-split-7-1778870302697-split-11-1779997678720-split-21-1780342111846-split-4-1780342168799","type":"direction","image":null,"index":86,"direction":"<p>For the barbecue sauce, combine the yellow mustard, honey, apple cider vinegar, brown sugar, ketchup, worcestershire sauce, garlic powder, hot sauce, salt and pepper in a bowl and mix well.</p>"},{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-5-1775059843771-split-9-1776104424006-split-4-1777312151121-split-11-1777312319520-split-4-1777990336148-split-7-1778870302697-split-11-1779997678720-split-21-1780342111846-split-5-1780342168799","type":"direction","image":null,"index":87,"direction":"<p>Using your stainless steel saucepan, simmer the barbecue sauce for 10 minutes. Let cool and refrigerate, covered, for as long as possible (ideally a day) to let the flavors combine.</p>"},{"id":"0-split-0-1774995433573-split-5-1775059843771-split-9-1776104424006-split-4-1777312151121-split-11-1777312319520-split-4-1777990336148-split-7-1778870302697-split-11-1779997678720-split-21-1780342111846-split-6-1780342168799","type":"direction","image":null,"index":88,"direction":"<p>When ready to serve, heat up the barbecue sauce and mix with the shredded pulled pork. Serve with buns, coleslaw, or whatever sides you like!</p>"}],"serving_size":"","prep_time":null,"cook_time":null,"recipe_image":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0622/1937/files/Pulled_Pork_Blog_Photo-1.jpg?v=1780342031","recipe_image_alt_text":"Slow Cooker Pulled Pork with Honey Mustard Barbecue Sauce","iso_prep_time":null,"iso_cook_time":null,"recipe_rating":"5.0000000000000000","enable_rating":true,"rating_count":"1","recipe_note":"","recipe_video":"","recipe_date":"2026-06-01T19:27:45.832+00:00","recipe_calories":null,"recipe_tags":[],"nutrition_data":[],"recipe_id":"2740829","nutrition_serving_size":"","nutrition_template":"horizontal","custom_fields":[]}

